abstract: "Windows desktop application for quantum error correction research and evaluation, built on the qector-decoder-v3 1.0.0 Rust/Python backend. Provides 16 decoder algorithms, 10 code families (including qLDPC and color codes), a full GUI, command-line interface, and a 82-tool Model Context Protocol (MCP) server. Portable, fully offline after first launch."
keywords:
  - "quantum error correction"
  - "QEC"
  - "decoder"
  - "surface code"
  - "qLDPC"
  - "MWPM"
  - "BP-OSD"
  - "Workbench"
